"The type of package, e.g. theme, wallpaper, plasmoid, dataengine, runner, "
"layout-template, etc."
msgstr ""
"Jenis pakej, contoh. theme, wallpaper, plasmoid, dataengine, runner, layout-"
"template, dan sebagainya."

